sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Request
  participant G as Governance
  participant P as PEP
  participant A as Audit Admission
  participant T as Tool Gateway
  participant S as Synthetic Resource
  participant L as Ledger
  R->>G: identity + context
  G->>P: verified governance context
  P->>A: admission request
  A->>L: append pre-action event
  A->>T: allow only if admitted
  T->>S: read-only synthetic operation
  S->>L: append result event
  S-->>R: controlled result
  P-->>R: DENY on any failed control
